    "## \u2705 Integration Complete!\n",
    "\n",
    "**Unified pipeline ready at:** `/content/speech_analyzer/models/presentation_analyzer.pkl`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Usage:**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import pickle\n",
    "with open('/content/speech_analyzer/models/presentation_analyzer.pkl', 'rb') as f:\n",
